# Code owners for Switchboard.
#
# GitHub requests a review from the owner of every file a pull request touches. The catch-all
# below means that is always @bryjshed, which is the intent: nothing lands here without the
# maintainer's approval.
#
# IMPORTANT: this file only REQUESTS review. Making it a requirement needs a branch protection
# rule on `main` with "Require review from Code Owners" enabled — CODEOWNERS on its own is a
# routing hint, not a gate. See .github/CONTRIBUTING.md.
#
# Last matching pattern wins, so the specific entries below sit after the catch-all.

* @bryjshed

# The two enforced contracts. A change to either is a change to what every SDK — including ones
